          "Day 3: 悬空寺 (Hanging Monastery) is now OPTIONAL. If skipped, the afternoon chartered car loop (云冈→悬空寺→大同) is also skipped. Consider 大同古城墙 (可选, 19:30-20:30, 30 CNY) as an alternative evening activity.",
